        "CopyrightInformation": "2011 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "This article is a case report of a veterinarian caring for a golden retriever with nasal cancer. It addresses the 5-step strategy for comprehensive palliative and hospice care protocol, which organizes examinations, consultations, and conversations with clients. The case report presents diagnosis, treatment, and euthanasia."
